# {{APP_CLI}}

CLI for the {{APP_NAME}} API. Generated with `api2cli`.

## Install

Prerequisite: install and link the local `api2cli` binary from `https://github.com/julien-m/api2cli`; do not use the third-party npm package named `api2cli` or `npx`.

```bash
api2cli install <user>/{{APP_CLI}}
```

This clones the repo, builds the CLI, links it to your PATH, and installs the AgentSkill through `cc-hub`.

## Usage

```bash
{{APP_CLI}} auth set "your-token"
{{APP_CLI}} auth test
{{APP_CLI}} --help
```

## AgentSkill Instructions

Write project-specific agent instructions in `.api2cli/skill/*.md`. `api2cli bundle {{APP_NAME}}` and `api2cli link {{APP_NAME}}` compile those fragments into `.agent-sync/skills/{{APP_CLI}}/SKILL.md`.

## Resources

Run `{{APP_CLI}} --help` to see available resources.

## Global Flags

All commands support: `--json`, `--format <text|json|csv|yaml>`, `--verbose`, `--no-color`, `--no-header`
